{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20260926/photo/bkn-20260926000020563-0926_00822_001_01p.jpg?20260926004604\"/><p>習近平伉儷向人士揮手道別。</p><p>中國國家主席習近平當地周五（25日）中午12時半左右結束國事訪問美國，乘專機啟程回國。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T16:58:19.674943+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":65,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"}}